# Dark mode

How this project's dark scheme is built and checked. Dark values live in the tokens file
(`$extensions.plumb.dark` on each token) and are generated into every platform output; do not
hard-code dark colours in components.

Add the principles for this project here (what the dark canvas is, how elevation reads, which
accents lighten for text). Everything between the markers below is generated: it is rewritten by
`build-tokens.py --contrast` and by every build, so edit the tokens file instead.

